{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Prismatic Shard is a ",["l","矿物","Mineral"],". It is one of the rarest items in the game, and has a variety of uses, including obtaining the ",["l","银河剑","Galaxy Sword"],"."]]]],["Locations",2,[["p",["Prismatic shards can be found in:"]],["l",0,[[1,["25% chance from a ",["l","采矿#Mystic Stone","Mystic Stone"]," in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," at floors 100+, ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", and ",["l","采石场","Quarry"],"."]],[1,["25% chance from a ",["l","随机事件#Meteorite","meteorite"],"."]],[1,["1/26 (≈3.8%) chance from a ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","treasure room"]," in the Skull Cavern."]],[1,["3.5% chance from an ",["l","采矿#Iridium Node","Iridium Node"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", ",["l","采石场","Quarry"]," and ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],"."]],[1,["0.4% chance from an ",["l","万象晶球","Omni Geode"],"."]],[1,["0.4% chance from a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"."]],[1,["0.1% chance from ",["l","飞蛇","Serpent"],"s and ",["l","木乃伊","Mummies"]," (and their dangerous variants). 0.05% chance from ",["l","暗影狂徒","Shadow Brute"],"s and ",["l","暗影萨满","Shadow Shaman"]," (and their dangerous variants)."]],[1,["0.1% chance from ",["l","荒野石魔","Wilderness Golem"],"s and ",["l","铱石魔","Iridium Golem"],"s after reaching ",["l","战斗","Combat"]," Level 10."]],[1,["0.79% chance from a ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"."]],[1,["0.09% daily chance from a ",["l","虹鳟鱼","Rainbow Trout"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," with a population of at least 9."]],[1,["0.05% chance from any ",["l","怪物","monster"]," after the player has reached the bottom of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."]],[1,["≈0.012% chance from a ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chest"]," after reaching ",["l","钓鱼#Fishing Skill","fishing level 6"],"."]],[1,["One in a chest at the top of the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]," the first time the player arrives there."]],[1,["Once per day from the ",["l","真正完美的雕像","Statue Of True Perfection"],"."]],[1,["Purchased from ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"]," for 500 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s when she hosts a ",["l","沙漠节#Villager Shop","shop"]," during the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],"."]],[1,["From the ",["l","祝福雕像#List of Blessings","Blessing Of The Butterfly"]," (up to a 17.5% chance)."]]]]]],["Uses",2,[["l",0,[[1,["A Prismatic Shard can be used in ",["l","沙漠","the Desert"]," to obtain the ",["l","银河剑","Galaxy Sword"],". The ",["l","墓园#Dwarvish Headstone","Dwarvish Headstone"]," in the graveyard contains a riddle explaining how to obtain it."]],[1,["A Prismatic Shard is one of the options used to complete ",["l","收集包#The Missing Bundle","the Missing Bundle"]," to unlock the ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"],"."]],[1,["A Prismatic Shard can be offered to the ",["l","私欲之黑暗神殿","Dark Shrine of Selfishness"]," at the ",["l","女巫小屋","Witch's Hut"]," to turn ",["l","孩子","children"]," into doves (getting rid of them permanently)."]],[1,["On ",["l","周循环#Thursday","Thursdays"]," the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," sells 1 ",["l","魔法糖冰棍","Magic Rock Candy"]," for 3 Prismatic Shards."]],[1,["Prismatic Shards are used to enchant tools in the ",["l","锻造","Forge"],"."]],[1,["A Prismatic Shard can be placed into a ",["l","祝尼魔屋","Junimo Hut"]," to cause the ",["l","祝尼魔","Junimo"]," to cycle through the rainbow resembling a Prismatic Shard."]],[1,["A Prismatic Shard can be donated to ",["l","冈瑟","Gunther"]," at the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"],"."]],[1,["A Prismatic Shard can be used in the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," to create prismatic clothing (see Tailoring below)."]],[1,["Prismatic Shards can be ",["l","友谊#Gifts","gifted"]," as a universally loved gift (to everyone except ",["l","海莉","Haley"],")."]],[1,[["l","合作","Multiplayer"]," only: A Prismatic Shard can be used to craft a ",["l","结婚戒指","Wedding Ring"]," to propose marriage to another player."]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","海莉","Haley"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["One Prismatic Shard is an option for The Missing Bundle."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Wedding_Ring.png",48]],[["l","结婚戒指","Wedding Ring"]],["An old Zuzu City tradition... It's used to ask for another farmer's hand in marriage.\nUsed only in ",["l","合作","multiplayer"]," games."],[["i","(O)337","Iridium Bar ×5"],["i","(O)74","Prismatic Shard ×1"]],[["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," 500g"]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Prismatic Shard is used in the spool of a ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," to create one of 5 random \"prismatic\" ",["l","裁缝","clothing items"],". It is possible to obtain duplicates before obtaining all 5 items."]],["l",0,[[1,[["f","Shirt223.png",24]," Prismatic Shirt"]],[1,[["f","Shirt288a.png",24]," Prismatic Shirt (white sleeves)"]],[1,[["f","Shirt289a.png",24]," Prismatic Shirt (black sleeves)"]],[1,[["f","Farmer_Pants.png",24]," Prismatic Pants"]],[1,[["f","Genie_Pants.png",24]," Prismatic Genie Pants"]]]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["4 Prismatic Shards are requested in ",["l","齐先生","Mr. Qi"],"'s ",["l","任务#Four Precious Stones","Four Precious Stones"]," quest."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Prismatic Shards cannot be duplicated in a ",["l","宝石复制机","Crystalarium"],". According to the Lost Book ",["l","遗失之书#Technology Report!","Technology Report!"],", \"the EMF from the shard interacts negatively with the crystalarium.\""]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.0","1.0"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.3.27","1.3.27"],": Added to all monster drop pools after player has reached the bottom of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Added as option for ",["l","收集包#Abandoned JojaMart","Missing Bundle"],". Fixed bug where an entire stack would be consumed when obtaining the ",["l","银河剑","Galaxy Sword"],". Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". Can be produced by ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"s."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can be used to ",["l","锻造#Enchantments","enchant tools"],". Obtained from the ",["l","真正完美的雕像","Statue Of True Perfection"],". One can be obtained at the top of the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],". Requested in ",["l","任务#Four Precious Stones","Four Precious Stones"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Chance of obtaining Prismatic Shard from ",["l","采矿#Iridium Node","Iridium Node"]," decreased from 4% to 3.5%. Can now be obtained from ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],", ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],", ",["l","随机事件#Meteorite","Meteorite"],", and ",["l","铱石魔","Iridium Golem"],". Can now be purchased from ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6.3","1.6.3"],": Reduced rate of the ",["l","随机事件#Meteorite","Meteorite"]," dropping a Prismatic Shard from 100% to 25%."]]]]]]]}